item~ function src/cloud.rs :: destination_id :: pub fn destination_id(&self) -> String { :: The identity of the destination the sync state belongs to. Confirmations recorded against any other destination are void: switching provider, bucket, container, prefix, region, or endpoint starts the new destination from unconfirmed. (Region and endpoint belong here as much as the bucket does: correcting a mistyped endpoint — same bucket, same prefix — once kept the old destination's confirmations, and the sync reported every file skipped while uploading nothing at all.) :: doc comment
